title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › What the page shows
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: One result, said once. A slim title row (the patient), then one card: the verdict band with the one fact that decides it and the actions, then Eligibility, Plan type and routing, Benefits, Patient pays (only when there is a cost share) and What this service needs as label and value rows, then a warning only when no row already says it, and one quiet facts line. The payment checks, how it was checked and History are behind one button, in a side panel. Reached by a row on the list, or when a live check finishes. A check at a site the viewer cannot see shows a notice instead.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click a row on the list, or a live check finishes"
decision qs "Is this check at a site the viewer can see?"
screen os "'This coverage check is not available at Site A'\nIt names no patient. Staff who may see both sites get 'Show Site B'"
screen sc "Title row (no card, no headline)\n'R-1042' (24 px) · 'J.M., 34' · 'Residential 3.5 · Summit Medicaid HMO (Ohio Medicaid)'\nA Site A or Site B tag when the view is narrowed"
click b1 "Click '← Eligibility & Benefits' (back link, top left)"
goto g0 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › List › What the screen shows"
click b2 "Click '← Back to referral RF-2040' beside it\nWith ?case= in the address it reads '← Back to case R-1042'\nShown only when ?referral= names a referral that exists"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The full referral page"

group gSum "The result card"
  screen vb "Verdict band, green, amber, red or grey\n'Authorization first' (18 px) | 'Authorization' 'In progress'\nThe verdict and the one fact behind it, as a value, no sentence"
  screen bt "Actions on a second line of the band, small buttons\n'Start authorization', 'Create authorization from verification', 'Request retro-eligibility',\n'Ask Caller to ...', 'Ask Navigator to check enrollment', 'Open Settings', 'Open case', 'Re-check'"
  screen rows "Label and value rows\n'Eligibility' pill and dates · 'Plan type and routing'\n'Benefits' pill, program, codes and limit · 'Patient pays' only with a cost share\n'What this service needs' pill and line, then the payer's saved rules"
  screen warn "A warning only when no row says it already\nToday that is one: a refresh that could not run while Verify is paused\n'Verification service unavailable. ... This is the last result.'"
  screen facts "One quiet facts line\nMember (masked), dates of service, time checked, source 'Simulated check against the payer portal'"
endgroup

toast t1 "Banner 'Not re-checked: Verify is paused in Settings'\n'Due Tue 11:32 am' with 'Open Settings'\nOnly when a booked re-check passed while Verify is paused"

group gRow "One row under the card"
  screen pc "'Verification details'\n'Payment checks: 6 of 7 pass, 1 needs a look'\nButton 'View full verification details'"
  click pk "Click 'View full verification details'"
  overlay ov "Side panel 'Verification details' opens from the right\nPayment checks, How this was checked, History\nThe page behind stays where it was"
endgroup

goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Which verdict and why"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The details panel"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Result first: eligibility, benefits, what the service needs"
goto g6 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Plan type and routing"
goto g7 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › The exceptions"
goto g8 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Sites"

s1 --> qs
qs -->|No| os --> g8
qs -->|Yes| sc
sc --> b1 --> g0
sc --> b2 --> g4
sc --> vb --> bt
vb -.-> g1
bt --> g3
vb --> rows --> warn --> facts
rows -.-> g5
rows -.-> g6
warn -.-> g7
sc -.-> t1
sc --> pc --> pk --> ov --> g2
